            "DialogCategory": "ExSkill",
            "VoiceClip": "Utaha_ExSkill_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Utaha/utaha_exskill_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "good kid."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 23004,
            "DialogCategory": "ExSkill",
            "VoiceClip": "Utaha_ExSkill_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Utaha/utaha_exskill_3",
            "LocalizeEN": "Maintenance completed and operation started."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 23004,
            "DialogCategory": "ExSkill",
            "VoiceClip": "Utaha_ExSkill_Level_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Utaha/utaha_exskill_level_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "This is the beast of the millennium."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 23004,
            "DialogCategory": "ExSkill",
            "VoiceClip": "Utaha_ExSkill_Level_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Utaha/utaha_exskill_level_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "Astonishing technology, it's good to burn it into your eyes"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 23004,
            "DialogCategory": "ExSkill",
            "VoiceClip": "Utaha_ExSkill_Level_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Utaha/utaha_exskill_level_3",
            "LocalizeEN": "This chair will ruin you."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 23004,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Utaha_Growup_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Utaha/utaha_growup_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "Your care feels warm."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 23004,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Utaha_Growup_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Utaha/utaha_growup_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "Upgrades improve the QOL of life, and my QOL is like this too"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 23004,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Utaha_Growup_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Utaha/utaha_growup_3",
            "LocalizeEN": "The more you use a machine, the more you will come to understand the kindness put into it."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 23004,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Utaha_Growup_4",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Utaha/utaha_growup_4",
            "LocalizeEN": "Making something for someone, that's what a meister's happiness is"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 23004,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Utaha_Relationship_Up_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Utaha/utaha_relationship_up_1",
            "LocalizeJP": "工房で物ばかり作ってたから……、\n会話は苦手なはずなんだけど、先生はちょっと違うね。",
            "LocalizeEN": "I've always been making things in the workshop...\n\nThat should make me bad at having chats, but with you it's different huh"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 23004,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Utaha_Relationship_Up_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Utaha/utaha_relationship_up_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "How strange, the human heart is. I don't know what kinds of mechanism it has, but it's pounding hard."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 23004,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Utaha_Relationship_Up_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Utaha/utaha_relationship_up_3",
            "LocalizeJP": "まだあくまでロマンに近いけど、いつか宇宙に行ってみたい。\n簡単ではないと思うけどその時は……先生も連れていってあげるよ。",
            "LocalizeEN": "It's more of romantic dream than realistic, but someday, I want to go to space.\n\nI know it won't be easy but when the time comes... I'll bring you along."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 23004,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Utaha_Relationship_Up_4",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Utaha/utaha_relationship_up_4",
            "LocalizeEN": "I am always in this workshop. Come over when you need... Come over whenever, Sensei."
        }
    ]
}
